        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Rect">Rect</ref> 6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">GAFOL SwaNE . Gafolswane gebyreð þæt he sylle his slyht be ðam ðe on lande stent.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Tenant swineherd It befits the tenant swineherd that he give his animals for slaughter according to [the custom] that stands on the estate.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[6] Gafolswane. Gafolswane gebyreð, þæt he sylle his slyht, be ðam ðe on lande stent.</ab>
